WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.250 --> 00:00:02.690
What is design thinking?

00:00:03.950 --> 00:00:09.149
At its simplest, it's a way of using
a designers toolkit to find new ideas,

00:00:09.149 --> 00:00:12.741
and discover innovative
ways of solving problems.

00:00:12.741 --> 00:00:15.540
It's human-centric.

00:00:15.540 --> 00:00:19.386
By putting yourself in your customers
shoes like a designer would,

00:00:19.386 --> 00:00:23.433
you observe problems from the inside out,
rather than the outside in,

00:00:23.433 --> 00:00:28.241
allowing you to not only answer questions,
but find the right questions to answer.

00:00:28.241 --> 00:00:28.741
[MUSIC]

